<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Granite Broadcast.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Granite Broadcast.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said analyst Rita Zanella Benson initiated Granite Broadcasting Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated loss $0.54 for 1996, earnings of $0.01 per share for 1997, and earnings $0.25 for 1998, versus loss $0.23 for 1995.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $17. Shares rose 5/8 to 12.</p>
</text>
